+# W1-to-W3 source-bound handoff — grouped repair candidate
+
+**Operation:** `TOI-W1-EVIDENCE-CENSUS-V1`, existing Macro #7107.
+**Candidate basis:** `15e4dfb0c9ddc788127d0954fd7d92414eefdcbf`, plus the preserved pending AST validator and its tests.
+**Disposition:** `DRAFT_SOURCE_BOUND_NOT_ADMITTED / SOURCE_CUSTODY_AND_ACCEPTANCE_HOLD`.
+**Authority:** selected=0; registered=0; outcomes_read=false; model_fit=false; production_effect=false; trading_authority=false.
+
+This handoff is a bounded candidate for adoption on the existing W1 source carrier. It is not a source custody transfer, an accepted preregistration, a replacement carrier or a compute grant. The exact repaired head must still be committed by the lawful source custodian, reviewed and accepted. The two earlier review scopes remain closed; this candidate's review is not complete. The original deterministic 20-method sample remains unchanged.
+
+## 1. W1 source facts delivered by the candidate
+
+There are 32 passports (12 P0, 10 P1, 8 P2, 2 archive), 29 equivalence classes, 65 aliases, 29 source receipts and 10 residual-family dispositions. The grouped candidate records 24 exact / 3 partial / 5 missing bindings, including P0 9 exact / 3 partial. Exact is a retained W1 local/source claim, not a calibrated forecast or blanket formula-parity proof.
+
+- The existing AST-based static resolver admits known generated catalog IDs without importing or executing engine code. It is preserved byte-for-byte from validator preimage `7a1804af0bd8a1c7fc19c5366883da92d210db6c12b2654396572241d47f60f2`.
+- The duplicate-member fixture uses a non-first-class relation so it reaches the cross-class membership guard; separate tests preserve rejection of zero or two first-class members. No guard is weakened.
+- `toi.bb_bandwidth` binds the numeric `engine/stock_technicals.py::bb_bandwidth` primitive (20, 2, ddof0, ratio units). Catalog/consumer and trailing-percentile use remain partial; no synthetic signal ID is invented.
+- `toi.donchian_fakeout` retains the original occurrence and frozen-boundary formula. The existing latest-break resets remain a documented partial mismatch; no production math changes.
+- `toi.rvol` remains partial because source-defined prior-20-completed-bar normalization differs from the local inclusive-current denominator. ConnorsRSI(3,2,100), existing DNRs, priorities, owners, aliases and formulas remain unchanged.
+
+## 2. Consume, do not restart, the later scientific decisions
+
+[TOI/S16 ruling 5985330888](https://github.com/mastermindx-market-intelligence/macro/pull/7107#issuecomment-5985330888) preserves historical all-FIRED_UP onset selection and its 12-trial ancestry. `volume_confirmed` is diagnostic unless a separately versioned subset is admitted. Activation forecasting is a distinct question, not authority to enter before release or revive the killed H2 construction. Registry-description repair remains owed. Def4's unrun proposal is not consumed research.
+
+The original R0 147-slot ceiling, Seat B R2 and supplementary 218-configuration/201-cell design are alternative proposal histories. Do not combine them into a larger search. The current proposed first-wave narrowing is [5985350325](https://github.com/mastermindx-market-intelligence/macro/pull/8332#issuecomment-5985350325); the proposed native mapping is [5985365086](https://github.com/mastermindx-market-intelligence/macro/pull/8332#issuecomment-5985365086). Both remain unadmitted.
+
