+Hold C2/C3, alternate compression sensors, Q2 retest, A2, remaining-path specifications, standalone Weekly, 240-minute and fixed195-minute studies, Combo slots and S16 historical comparator outside the first wave. A qualified 13-completed-Weekly context is not a standalone252-observation Weekly compression study. Held objects are not spare Daily trials after results are known. No nonexistent downside incumbent is fabricated.
+
+## 4. Unresolved bindings before registration or compute
+
+| Binding | Existing owner | Required accepted evidence |
+|---|---|---|
+| W1 source custody and semantics | Existing #7107 custodian and review owner | Immutable grouped head; pending-preimage preservation; native validators/hostile tests; changed-findings review; Agent OS and current integration/hosted proof; parent acceptance. |
+| Population and missingness | Data OS and native data owners | Dated eligibility/security/listing/venue/type denominator, delistings and exclusions; no present-day file-count substitute for historical PIT support. |
