+| Controls | Existing Evaluation | Exact simple-breakout comparator and placebo seed/matching rules, no opportunistic redraw. |
+| Outcomes/inference | Existing Evaluation | Frozen endpoints/result columns, folds/embargo/purge, uncertainty/multiplicity, support/power and every repeated look/secondary diagnostic. |
+| Exposure and holdout | Existing Evaluation | Prior design/data/outcome exposure history, untouched holdout or explicit prospective accrual policy, versioned changes before access. |
+| Compute permission | Existing runtime/harness owner | Explicit opening decision, admitted worker/attempt/resource/repair limits and sealed result return; no raw provider launch or idle-worker outcome access. |
+
+The W2 source and records states are independent: #7094's current-base waiver composition and truthful record acceptance do not admit a mixed Daily/Weekly/4H panel. Consume the newer basis/precision ruling5985471173 rather than restarting broad archaeology. Provider-hourly fallback is not exact09:30-open4H evidence; mixed raw Daily/adjusted intraday and unreceipted live-tail remain held.
+
+## 5. Native accounting and budget meaning
+
+Use the existing TrialLedger with one proposed family `toi_w3_r0`, subject to owner adoption. After all preceding gates clear and before outcome compute, itemize the exact native configuration dictionaries and record the accepted declared-budget floor. The proposed floor22 plus22 itemized configs is a floor, not44 trials; real searched variants beyond the adopted set must be counted and cannot hide in eight contrast labels.
+
+Native identity hashes family+canonical config. Separate `source` and `info_cutoff` are metadata, not new hashed choices. Every material searched code/data-cut/population/basis/clock/model/policy/endpoint choice must therefore bind inside the admitted config or its immutable content reference. Prespecified prospective accrual and repeated looks follow their own accepted policy; namespaces do not prove statistical independence or erase selection history. An empty native ledger reports `effective_n()==1` despite zero itemized/declaration rows: positive effective N is not proof of registration.
+
+The synthetic17-test contract proof on #8332/51db78fb is already consumed; do not repeat it without a changed dependency. Its fake fixture families are not real TOI registrations. Preserve S16's12 historical trials in their existing family; never relabel or add them into TOI's proposed22. The donor and R0 unrun ceilings are recorded provenance, not falsely counted as executed trials.
+
+## 6. First consumer and final acceptance
+
+Permitted preparation is the existing descriptive Preparing/Active journey with original geometry, first-known time, typed freshness/contradiction and retained failure history. Use existing Macro, Terminal and Alert Center owners and design tokens, not a new store or ranker. Until separately qualified, forecasts stay not yet calibrated. Confluence repair#8428 is a distinct existing trust fix, not completion of TOI.
+
+After an explicit W3 opening, execute only the admitted study and retain positive, null and inconclusive results. Each predictive head earns source/support/calibration separately. Prospectively record predictions before outcomes, let declared cohorts mature, and obtain served-user and consumer-specific acceptance. W1 metadata validation, this handoff and a green CI do not create Prophet population/rank/gate, entry, sizing, execution or trading authority.
